### MCDT World, Player & Screen Inspection
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:25580
@token = test-token

### 1. Player kinematics, health & stats (409 Conflict if in menu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/player
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 2. Player inventory (409 Conflict if in menu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/player/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 3. World environment & dimension info (409 Conflict if in menu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/world
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 4. Query block states in bounding box (409 Conflict if in menu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/world/blocks?from=0,60,0&to=5,65,5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 5. Spatial entity lookup (409 Conflict if in menu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/world/entities?radius=32.0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 6. Raycast query (crosshair or arbitrary ray)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/world/raycast?maxDistance=20.0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 7. Active GUI screen & widget tree
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/screen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 8. HUD & overlay telemetry (action bar, title, boss bars, scoreboard, tablist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/hud
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 9. Structured view (visible blocks from camera frustum)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/view/blocks?res=128x72&grid=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 10. Structured view summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/view/blocks/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 11. Batch read operations in one client tick
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requests": [
    { "id": "player", "path": "/v1/player" },
    { "id": "world", "path": "/v1/world" },
    { "id": "hud", "path": "/v1/hud" }
  ]
}

### 12. Player statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 13. Player statistics filtered by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/stats?category=mined
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 14. Player advancements
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/advancements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 15. Player advancements filtered by completed status
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/advancements?done=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 16. Recipes unlocked in recipe book
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/recipes?craftable=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 17. Place recipe into active crafting container
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/recipes/place
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipeId": 1,
  "useMaxItems": false
}
